id: pm-vcs-nz10
title: Exclude nested pm-vcs control directories from staging and materialization
description: "Separate follow-up to the existing control-directory fence in pm-vcs-aujy. The working-tree walker excludes .pmvcs only at the repository root, while ALWAYS_IGNORED omits .pmvcs. A scratch parent repository with a nested agent-a repository stages agent-a/.pmvcs/credentials.json on unrestricted add; this can publish clone credentials and other private control state. Fix the general staging, explicit-add, status and materialization fence; cover nested control directories and malicious stored trees. This is outside the two requested PR #91 defects."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 0
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-05T08:48:37.876Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-07T20:12:08.751Z"
author: codex-sol
parent: pm-vcs-5h6j
repro_steps: "Initialize a scratch parent Repository and agent-a child Repository; add an authenticated origin to the child RemoteStore; call parent.stage([]); parent.readIndex() contains agent-a/.pmvcs/credentials.json."
expected_result: Own control directories remain private at every nesting depth and cannot be materialized from stored trees.
actual_result: The synthetic reproduction at e131473 returned nestedControlTracked=true.
